3
00:00:04.834 --> 00:00:07.278
India chose something different.

4
00:00:07.625 --> 00:00:10.194
Rajeev Bhargava calls India's model

5
00:00:10.194 --> 00:00:11.973
principled distance.

6
00:00:11.973 --> 00:00:13.736
The state may engage with

7
00:00:13.736 --> 00:00:16.119
religions, to reform or protect,

8
00:00:16.119 --> 00:00:17.766
but even-handedly.

9
00:00:18.482 --> 00:00:21.170
Article 25 guarantees freedom of

10
00:00:21.170 --> 00:00:23.780
religion. Articles 29 and 30

11
00:00:23.780 --> 00:00:27.734
protect minorities' culture and institutions.

12
00:00:28.114 --> 00:00:30.348
The syllabus also covers religious

13
00:00:30.348 --> 00:00:32.534
